DirkuLator 0.5.2 (probe part; rendering unchanged): EDEN_TASK_PROBE rotates task-draw probes over shadow, view (8+ tasks)
and other targets (kind=other), and probes mesh draws without a task program (kind=plain) from their own output buffer.
The memory change of 0.5.2 (headless/staging_buffers.h: exact staging sizes in 1 MiB steps) is not in this layer.

